<title>HONG KONG: Cosmopolitan Int'l 1996 net up 301.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Cosmopolitan Int'l 1996 net up 301.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   29.2	 vs  7.3 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    27.0	 vs  10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  15.61 gain vs  9.58 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    32.31	vs  8.05</p>
<p>    Turnover		     395.88     vs  88.59</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cosmopolitan International</p>
<p>				     Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 18-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 27</p>
<p>NOTE - Cosmopolitan International Holdings is engaged in real estate and securities investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$16.11 million on disposal of investment properties, net of disposal expenses and loss of HK$0.50 million on provision for diminution in value of quoted investments.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings has been adjusted to reflect the capitalisation issue of shares during the year.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 27 H.K. cents vs 10 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
